              which has a presentation by a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+presheaf"} simplicial presheaf
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝒢
                      %mo •
