              with values in 2-coskeletak Kan complexes where objects and morphisms are represented by a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
              each, and consider it equipped with the induced
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/atlas"} atlas
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
