              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+groupoid"} smooth groupoid
              presented by the presheaf of groupoids whose
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  smoothyl
                  = succeed "-parameterized" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
